WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

02:10.690 --> 02:13.070
What's going on?

02:13.070 --> 02:14.690
The Petit Claire is...

02:14.690 --> 02:16.900
Has something happened?

02:20.870 --> 02:23.580
What's going on?

02:40.640 --> 02:47.310
Tears of Separation with the Angel Fin

03:54.880 --> 03:56.090
All right!

04:19.110 --> 04:20.070
Hey.

04:20.070 --> 04:21.990
Where did you find that?

04:21.990 --> 04:24.410
It was at the junk yard.

04:24.410 --> 04:26.700
Can you really ride that thing?

04:26.700 --> 04:32.080
Accelerator, brake, cylinder head... There are many broken parts...

04:32.080 --> 04:33.460
But the engine...

04:33.460 --> 04:35.370
...is perfectly fine!

04:36.670 --> 04:40.000
You better get some sleep, or you're going to regret it during the race.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.800
Yeah, I know.

04:54.600 --> 04:56.440
Wow! This is great!

05:21.670 --> 05:24.420
Maron!

05:24.420 --> 05:26.380
Maron, where are you?!

05:26.380 --> 05:28.470
Fin, do you want some fried eggs?

05:29.800 --> 05:33.310
It's an emergency! I found a Demon!

05:33.310 --> 05:36.640
The bike of the racer Saotome Nobutaka is...

05:36.640 --> 05:38.020
Saotome?

05:38.020 --> 05:38.980
You know him?

05:38.980 --> 05:39.810
Yeah.

05:41.150 --> 05:44.780
He's currently the new racing star in the public's eye.

05:44.780 --> 05:47.660
Maron, please seal the Demon!

05:47.660 --> 05:50.830
But the Petit Claire is...

06:03.380 --> 06:07.510
What?! A notice from Kaitou Jeanne?!

06:07.510 --> 06:11.350
Where?! Okay, I'll be right there!

06:11.350 --> 06:12.680
Yes!

06:13.720 --> 06:15.890
I'M GOING!

06:17.480 --> 06:18.730
What about breakfast?

06:18.730 --> 06:20.860
There was a notice from Jeanne!

06:20.860 --> 06:23.650
Sorry Mom, but you're eating alone!

06:26.190 --> 06:27.740
Geez!

06:30.570 --> 06:37.620
<i>Notice to Saotome Motors-sama: I am taking the beauty of the blue racing bike. - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

06:43.540 --> 06:45.090
I'm past the red zone...

06:45.090 --> 06:47.920
...but the valve won't surge!

06:58.390 --> 07:00.230
Don't get in my way!

07:26.000 --> 07:28.130
Wow! That was an excellent lap!

07:32.090 --> 07:35.100
It's a very nice bike. Very powerful.

07:36.810 --> 07:40.020
I always wanted to ride a motorcycle when I was young.

07:46.440 --> 07:47.360
Dad!

07:47.360 --> 07:52.070
I can go full throttle on this bike and it won't make a sound!

07:53.410 --> 07:55.070
Who are these people?

07:55.070 --> 07:58.290
We have heard that you received a notice from Kaitou Jeanne.

07:58.290 --> 08:01.210
Hmph. It's probably just a prank.

08:01.210 --> 08:02.710
How stupid!

08:03.830 --> 08:07.090
Nobutaka, watch your attitude!

08:07.090 --> 08:10.670
I apologize. He's usually much more considerate.

08:10.670 --> 08:13.090
We don't blame him for his skepticism.

08:13.090 --> 08:18.220
Even we don't understand why Jeanne wants to steal a bike.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.890
But this is great!

08:20.890 --> 08:24.270
I want one, too! I understand how Kaitou Jeanne feels!

08:24.270 --> 08:29.480
She's a weird thief who steals both rags and riches.

08:29.480 --> 08:31.240
Anyway, she's just unpredictable.

08:31.240 --> 08:32.820
That's not it!

08:32.820 --> 08:37.200
She's an unforgivable criminal, who challenges the police and taunts them.

08:43.370 --> 08:44.370
Class President.

08:44.370 --> 08:45.960
Good morning.

08:45.960 --> 08:48.290
What are you doing this early in the morning?

08:48.290 --> 08:53.630
Yesterday, Toudaiji-san and Kusakabe-san said that they wanted to see my homework...

08:53.630 --> 08:55.590
So I'm here to give it to them.

08:55.590 --> 08:59.600
I think they're at Miyako's place. Have you checked there?

08:59.600 --> 09:04.690
Not yet. I want to see Kusakabe-san's face first.

09:04.690 --> 09:07.480
Oh, good morning.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.980
Good morning.

09:08.980 --> 09:10.940
Good morning. You're up very early.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.440
Is Miyako-san home?

09:12.440 --> 09:14.280
No, she left.

09:14.280 --> 09:18.070
What? We promised to meet first thing in the morning.

09:18.070 --> 09:22.620
I'm sorry. There was another notice.

09:22.620 --> 09:23.450
What?!

09:23.450 --> 09:24.710
From Kaitou Jeanne?!

09:26.460 --> 09:29.040
She's only a high school girl, but she acts like a police officer...

09:29.040 --> 09:32.670
Do you know where Jeanne's notice was sent to?

09:32.670 --> 09:35.340
No idea. She's such a troublesome girl.

09:36.760 --> 09:40.100
Man, I slept well!

09:40.100 --> 09:42.640
Access! Jeanne sent a notice!

09:42.640 --> 09:43.850
What?!

09:43.850 --> 09:45.730
You were beaten by Fin again!

09:45.730 --> 09:49.560
Oh, man! I'm going to find out where that Demon is!

10:23.810 --> 10:26.680
I bet there are a lot of police on guard.

10:26.680 --> 10:27.640
Be careful.

10:27.640 --> 10:28.810
Okay, Fin!

10:37.700 --> 10:39.700
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

10:48.000 --> 10:49.870
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

10:49.870 --> 10:51.750
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

10:51.750 --> 10:53.250
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

10:54.000 --> 10:55.630
<i>Game Start!</i>

10:58.300 --> 11:00.090
Jeanne has arrived!

11:01.010 --> 11:02.760
Fire the tear gas!

11:10.600 --> 11:11.400
We did it!

11:18.990 --> 11:20.490
It's a dummy!

11:20.490 --> 11:21.240
Damn!

11:29.790 --> 11:32.080
<i>Three minutes until start time.</i>

11:32.080 --> 11:34.290
<i>Mechanics must leave the race track!</i>

11:39.260 --> 11:40.550
All right!

11:45.180 --> 11:46.640
A balloon doll...

11:49.430 --> 11:51.940
Miyako-san, we lost Jeanne.

11:57.520 --> 12:00.610
<i>All the bikes started instantly!</i>

12:00.610 --> 12:06.830
<i>They're going full throttle towards the first clipping point!</i>

12:13.790 --> 12:15.790
<i>The first to be in the lead is...</i>

12:15.790 --> 12:17.790
<i>...number 3, Saotome!</i>

12:17.790 --> 12:18.550
<i>That's him...</i>

12:21.010 --> 12:21.970
STOP!

12:25.050 --> 12:27.600
Miyako Special, Part Thirteen!

12:27.600 --> 12:28.810
Miyako!

12:28.810 --> 12:31.480
Operation "Everyone's a Cop!"

12:31.480 --> 12:35.560
Jeanne, I'm not letting you go this time!

12:35.560 --> 12:38.020
<i>The machines have entered the S-curves!</i>

12:39.570 --> 12:43.990
<i>They're putting on the brakes and carving the curves!</i>

12:49.330 --> 12:51.950
Notice

12:49.330 --> 12:51.950
Don't go away!

12:49.330 --> 12:51.950
I'll return right after these messages!

12:49.330 --> 12:51.950
Kaitou Jeanne

12:52.830 --> 12:55.460
Notice

12:52.830 --> 12:55.460
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:52.830 --> 12:55.460
Kaitou Jeanne

13:07.090 --> 13:13.230
Jeanne, you have no place to hide. You've lost so, give up!

13:13.230 --> 13:16.190
<i>Miyako, you're always so confident.</i>

13:18.980 --> 13:20.320
Rebound Ball.

13:22.650 --> 13:24.240
Charge! Arrest Jeanne!

13:32.950 --> 13:34.200
Don't let her get away!

13:43.090 --> 13:44.760
- What?!

13:44.050 --> 13:44.760
- Jeanne!

13:56.310 --> 13:57.600
Jeanne!

15:06.260 --> 15:07.090
Sinbad!

15:07.090 --> 15:09.590
Damn, I hurt my leg...

15:09.590 --> 15:11.010
You should have minded your own business...!

15:11.010 --> 15:12.760
Jeanne, go!

15:12.760 --> 15:14.930
I can't do that! I'll carry you!

15:17.470 --> 15:18.680
Don't move!

15:18.680 --> 15:19.440
Jeanne!

15:23.690 --> 15:25.690
In the name of God...

15:25.690 --> 15:28.320
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

15:31.700 --> 15:33.740
I seal you here!

15:36.410 --> 15:38.200
<i>Checkmate!</i>

15:59.980 --> 16:03.400
Maron! Maron, are you okay?!

16:06.520 --> 16:08.400
Fin, the Rosary...

16:08.400 --> 16:12.900
I know, I saw. I wonder why it turned into an Angel's Feather?

16:12.900 --> 16:14.820
An Angel's Feather?

16:14.820 --> 16:17.830
Ahhh! Access is taking the Petit Claire!

16:17.830 --> 16:20.540
This is something you shouldn't have!

16:20.540 --> 16:22.500
Wait!

16:22.500 --> 16:26.500
It's not fair to steal the chess pieces we've collected!

16:26.500 --> 16:29.050
It's for your own good!

16:29.050 --> 16:31.760
Stop making things up!

16:31.760 --> 16:34.800
I'm not letting one of the Devil's servants steal it!

16:40.430 --> 16:41.810
Access...?

16:41.810 --> 16:44.310
What just happened?

16:45.980 --> 16:48.480
Maron!

16:48.480 --> 16:49.730
Look!

16:59.830 --> 17:04.290
I knew it! We've collected all the chess pieces!

17:04.290 --> 17:05.870
What do you mean?

17:05.870 --> 17:09.380
You remember what happened to the Petit Claire last night, don't you?

17:09.380 --> 17:16.130
I think it was a sign that there was only one more Demon to seal until completion.

17:16.130 --> 17:19.890
I know why the Rosary disappeared!

17:19.890 --> 17:27.100
The Rosary disappeared as a sign that Demons no longer exist in the human world.

17:27.100 --> 17:31.610
The Rosary disappeared because its work of sealing Demons was finished.

17:31.610 --> 17:32.610
Are you sure?

17:32.610 --> 17:33.610
Positive!

17:34.650 --> 17:38.070
Hooray! Maron, we did it!

17:43.700 --> 17:45.250
Access, are you all right?

17:47.120 --> 17:49.080
It looks like the last chess piece...

17:49.080 --> 17:52.630
...completed the set...

17:52.630 --> 17:54.460
This is terrible!

17:58.010 --> 18:00.550
Nobutaka, what happened?!

18:00.550 --> 18:01.760
Where's the bike?!

18:01.760 --> 18:04.060
It was stolen by Kaitou Jeanne, wasn't it?

18:04.060 --> 18:09.690
I feel like I've been having a strange dream since yesterday...

18:09.690 --> 18:12.690
I was captivated by the bike's power...

18:12.690 --> 18:13.940
And...

18:14.940 --> 18:19.110
A weird dream... Come to think of it, there have been others who...

18:19.110 --> 18:21.490
If it was a bad dream, then just forget about it.

18:21.490 --> 18:22.280
Yeah...

18:23.080 --> 18:26.200
Dad, I'm going to win the next race!

18:26.200 --> 18:27.410
Do your best!

18:29.000 --> 18:32.130
Thank you for all that you have done.

18:32.130 --> 18:34.800
Oh, no. We're just glad you're safe.

18:34.800 --> 18:36.300
Something's strange...

18:36.300 --> 18:40.390
<i>Everyone who had contact with Jeanne became calm again...</i>

19:07.410 --> 19:11.380
Maron, you don't have to be Jeanne anymore. We're done!

19:14.500 --> 19:20.090
Once I give God all the chess pieces we've collected, His strength will increase.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.550
That means that the Devil becomes weaker...

19:22.550 --> 19:24.890
...and he won't be able to touch the Human World!

19:24.890 --> 19:26.310
Can I believe that?

19:26.310 --> 19:27.560
Yes!

19:27.560 --> 19:29.930
This is all thanks to you, Maron.

19:29.930 --> 19:34.060
Thank you for being courageous and for fighting all this time!

19:34.060 --> 19:37.480
Are you sure there aren't any more Demons in this world?

19:37.480 --> 19:43.820
Oh, yes! My job will be complete as soon as I deliver this to God.

19:43.820 --> 19:46.160
Does this mean "Goodbye?"

19:46.160 --> 19:46.790
Yeah.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.040
No way...

19:48.040 --> 19:50.710
But only for a little while.

19:50.710 --> 19:51.710
How little?

19:51.710 --> 19:53.750
Maybe about a week?

19:53.750 --> 19:56.250
Once I give God the chess pieces,

19:56.250 --> 20:00.130
...I'll be promoted from Semi-Angel to Full-Angel!

20:00.130 --> 20:03.640
I'll be back as soon as I become a Full-Angel, okay?

20:03.640 --> 20:05.850
Are you really coming back?

20:05.850 --> 20:11.690
Maron, are you going to be lonely while I'm gone?

20:11.690 --> 20:15.980
What are you talking about? I'll be relieved when your loud mouth is gone.

20:20.240 --> 20:26.490
Even though the Demons are gone, be careful of Sinbad and Access.

20:26.490 --> 20:27.740
I know.

20:27.740 --> 20:32.500
Maron, I'm sorry I've put you through some dangerous times.

20:32.500 --> 20:38.130
Thank you so much for listening to my wish. Thank you so, so much...

20:39.800 --> 20:44.220
What?! You'll be back in a week, right? Cheer up!

20:44.220 --> 20:44.930
But...

20:50.140 --> 20:51.810
Come on, come on!

20:51.810 --> 20:55.850
"Strong and serious, matchless and marvelous..."

20:55.850 --> 20:57.480
And as an added bonus...

20:57.480 --> 20:59.610
"Energetic and courageous..."

21:02.240 --> 21:05.110
That's right, Fin! Now go become a great Full-Angel!

21:05.110 --> 21:06.570
Okay.

21:06.570 --> 21:09.030
Maron, wait for me.

21:11.040 --> 21:14.540
<i>Fin, please come back...</i>

21:19.710 --> 21:21.590
Fin-chan is...

21:21.590 --> 21:25.260
Now there's going to be a lot of trouble!

21:43.280 --> 21:45.900
Fin, hurry back...

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:33.550 --> 23:36.560
A boring world, disgusting creatures...

23:36.560 --> 23:40.560
- If it weren't for the Devil's orders, I'd never come to a place like this!

23:39.480 --> 23:40.560
- Kusakabe Maron...

23:40.560 --> 23:47.230
- Jeanne can't transform anymore and is just a normal girl now. Let's finish the job and go home.

23:45.770 --> 23:47.230
- <i>If </i>we can get rid of her.

23:47.230 --> 23:49.400
- What? You don't have any confidence?

23:49.400 --> 23:54.240
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Demons' Advent! Time of New Transformation!

23:54.240 --> 23:57.700
Don't underestimate the strength of God's protection of Jeanne.
